:04.130" end="01:04.310">it's </span><span begin="01:04.310" end="01:04.640">not </span><span begin="01:04.640" end="01:05.450">alright</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.480" end="01:10.490"><span begin="01:05.480" end="01:05.990">So </span><span begin="01:05.990" end="01:06.200">I'm </span><span begin="01:06.200" end="01:08.030">breaking </span><span begin="01:08.030" end="01:08.660">the </span><span begin="01:08.660" end="01:10.490">habit</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.760" end="01:18.020"><span begin="01:10.760" end="01:11.060">I'm </span><span begin="01:11.060" end="01:12.860">breaking </span><span begin="01:12.860" end="01:13.430">the </span><span begin="01:13.430" end="01:15.440">habit </span><span begin="01:15.440" end="01:18.020">tonight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.140" end="01:23.660"><span begin="01:21.140" end="01:22.370">Clutching </span><span begin="01:22.370" end="01:22.910">my </span><span begin="01:22.910" end="01:23.660">cure</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.870" end="01:26.030"><span begin="01:23.870" end="01:24.140">I </span><span begin="01:24.140" end="01:24.620">tightly </span><span begin="01:24.620" end="01:25.130">lock </span><span begin="01:25.130" end="01:25.250">the </span><span begin="01:25.250" end="01:26.030">door</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.270" end="01:29.510"><span begin="01:26.270" end="01:26.510">I </span><span begin="01:26.510" end="01:26.930">try </span><span begin="01:26.930" end="01:26.990">to </span><span begin="01:26.990" end="01:27.500">catch </span><span begin="01:27.500" end="01:27.740">my </span><span begin="01:27.740" end="01:28.160">breath </span><span begin="01:28.160" end="01:29.510">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.500" end="01:33.320"><span begin="01:30.500" end="01:31.400">I </span><span begin="01:31.400" end="01:31.940">hurt </span><span begin="01:31.940" end="01:32.570">much </span><span begin="01:32.570" end="01:33.320">more</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.440" end="01:35.840"><span begin="01:33.440" end="01:33.830">than </span><span begin="01:33.830" end="01:34.730">anytime </span><span begin="01:34.730" end="01:35.840">before</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.870" end="01:39.740"><span begin="01:35.870" end="01:36.200">I </span><span begin="01:36.200" end="01:36.500">have </span><span begin="01:36.500" end="01:36.740">no </span><span begin="01:36.740" end="01:37.460">options </span><span begin="01:37.460" end="01:37.790">left </span><span begin="01:37.790" end="01:39.740">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.770" end="01:42.020"><span begin="01:39.770" end="01:40.100">I </span><span begin="01:40.100" end="01:40.250">don't </span><span begin="01:40.250" end="01:40.700">want </span><span begin="01:40.700" end="01:40.970">to </span><span begin="01:40.970" end="01:41.300">be </span><span begin="01:41.300" end="01:41.450">the </span><span begin="01:41.450" end="01:42.020">one</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.050" end="01:44.210"><span begin="01:42.050" end="01:42.200">the </span><span begin="01:42.200" end="01:42.770">battles </span><span begin="01:42.770" end="01:43.280">always </span><span begin="01:43.280" end="01:44.210">choose</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.240" end="01:46.820"><span begin="01:44.240" end="01:44.630">'Cause </span><span begin="01:44.630" end="01:45.590">inside </span><span begin="01:45.590" end="01:45.800">I </span><span begin="01:45.800" end="01:46.820">realize</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.850" end="01:49.040"><span begin="01:46.850" end="01:47.060">that </span><span begin="01:47.060" end="01:47.360">I'm </span><span begin="01:47.360" end="01:47.450">the </span><span begin="01:47.450" end="01:47.900">one </span><span begin="01:47.900" end="01:49.040">confused</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.100" end="01:51.590"><span begin="01:49.100" end="01:49.370">I </span><span begin="01:49.370" end="01:49.700">don't </span><span begin="01